hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
2918,abdalrhmn by۔ kab b malk nay kha kh maaz b۔ jbl ayk skhy nwjwan tha jw kchh bhy nhyn bcha skta tha awr hmyshh qrz lyta rhta tha، takh as nay apny tmam jayydad apnay qrzwn pr khrch kr dy۔ wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya awr aap say kha kh wh apnay qrz khwahwn say bat kryn، awr agr wh ksy kw qrz maaf kr dytay tw wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khatr maaz kay lyay kr dytay، lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an kw apny jayydad bych dy kh maaz kay pas kchh nhyn bcha۔ asay sayd nay apny snn myn mrsl ky swrt myn nql kya hay۔
2919,"alshryd say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’asbab rkhnay walay ky adayygy myn takhyr as ky bay azty awr sza kw hlal kr dyty hay۔‘‘ abn almbark nay kha kh \bay azty\"" ka mtlb hay kh as say skhty say bat ky jayay awr \""sza\"" ka mtlb hay kh as kay lyay asay qyd kya jayay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
2920,"abwsayd alkhdrl rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk lash laya gya takh aap as pr nmaz ada kryn، aap nay lwgwn say pwchha kh kya aap kay dwst pr kchh wajb hay؟ yh btanay pr kh as nay aysa kya hay، as nay pwchha kh kya aap nay as kw khtm krnay kay lyay kchh chhwra hay، awr jb anhwn nay jwab dya kh as kay pas nhyn hay، tw as nay an say kha kh as pr daa kryn۔ lykn aly by۔ abw talb nay kha kh myn as kay qrz ka zmh dar hwn ga، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm aagay brhay awr as pr daa ky۔ ayk wrzhn myn bhy kchh aysa hy asr hay، anhwn nay mzyd kha kh \khda aap kay ahd kw jhnm say chhrayay jysa kh aap nay apnay mslman bhayy kay ahdwn kw chhraya hay! kwyy bhy mslman apnay bhayy ka qrz nhyn ataray ga jb tk kh allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn as kay ahdwn kw ada nh kray۔\"" yh shara alsnh myn mntql hwta hay۔"""
2921,swban rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ghrwr، bay wfayy awr qrz say bay nyaz hw kr mray tw wh jnt myn dakhl hw ga۔ asay trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔
2922,hzrt abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: allh kay nzdyk an sngyn gnahwn kay bad jn say allh taalyٰ nay mna frmaya hay، sb say bra gnah yh hay kh wh qrz myn mray bghyr as kay ada krnay kay lyay kafy hay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔
2923,"amrw by۔ awf almzny rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mslmanwn kay drmyan slh jayz hay swayay as kay kh hlal kw hram kr day، ya hram kw hlal kr day، awr mslmanwn pr lazm hay kh wh an shrayt pr qaym rhyn jw anhwn nay ky hyn، swayay as shrt kay jw hram chyz kw hlal kr day، ya ksy hram chyz kw hlal kr day“۔ asay trmzy، abn majh awr abwdaod nay nql kya hay، lykn abwdaod ky rwayt \an ky wza krdh shrayt\"" pr khtm hwyy۔"""
2924,swyd b. qys nay kha: mkhrfh alabdy awr myn nay hjr* say kchh kpray mngwayay awr mkh lay aayay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray pas pydl chltay hwyay tshryf layay awr anhwn nay hm say kchh ptlwn ka swda kr lya tw hm nay anhyn bych dya۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay whan ayk aadmy say jw tnkhwah kay lyay twl rha tha، frmaya: ”twlw awr zyadh wzn dw“۔ *albhryn kay pwray zla pr ayk nam ka atlaq hwta hay۔ ahmd، abwdaod، trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn shyh hay۔
2925,jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm pr qrz tha awr jb aap nay asay ada kya tw asay kchh azafy dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
2926,abdallh by۔ abw rbyah khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say chalys hzar qrz lya، awr jb aamdny hwyy tw aap nay asay yh khh kr ada kr dya kh allh aap kay ahl w ayal awr aap kay mal myn brkt ata frmayay، qrz ka wahd bdlh taryf awr wapsy hay۔ * mtn myn nmbr ka zkr hay۔ ghalbaً as ka mtlb drhm hay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔
2927,amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ksy kay pas ksy dwsray ky trf say kwyy chyz hw tw asay hr rwz kay lyay sdqh dya jayay ga، wh dwsray kw adayygy mltwy krnay ky ajazt dyta hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔
2928,"sad b۔ atwal nay kha: myra bhayy tyn sw dynar awr kchh chhwtay bchay chhwr kr mr gya awr myn nay an kw an ky kfalt kay lyay astamal krna chaha، lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say frmaya: tmhara bhayy qrz ky wjh say qyd hay، lhza asay as ky trf say ada kr dw۔ myn nay ja kr aysa kya awr waps aa kr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya kh myn nay yh kya hay awr srf ayk awrt rh gyy js nay dw dynar ka dawyٰ kya tha lykn as kay pas kwyy sbwt nhyn tha jw wh dkha skty thy۔ as nay jwab dya، \anhyn day dw، kywnkh wh sch bwl rhy hay۔\"" ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""
2929,mhmd by abdallh by۔ jhsh nay kha: jb hm msjd kay shn myn bythay hwyay thay jhan byryan bchhy hwyy thyn awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray drmyan bythay hwyay thay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apny aankhyn aasman ky trf athayyn awr dykha، phr aankhyn nychy kr kay mathay pr hath rkh kr frmaya: ”sbhan allh، allh ky qsm! ktny skhty atry hay“۔ hm nay sara dn awr rat kchh nhyn kha awr sbh tk achha tjrbh nhyn kya۔ phr myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh yh kya skhty hay jw atry hay tw aap nay frmaya: as ka talq qrz say hay، as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn mhmd ky jan hay، agr kwyy shkhs rahِ khda myn mara jayay tw zndh hw jayay، rahِ khda myn mara jayay tw phr zndh hw jayay، awr ayk bar phr rahِ khda myn mara jayay tw qrz ada nh hw، jb tk wh qrz ada nh kr lay۔ ahmd nay asay nql kya hay awr shrh alsn myn bhy kchh aysa hy asr hay۔
2930,"zhrh by۔ mabd nay kha kh an kay dada abdallh bn hsham asay bazar lay jata awr ghlh khrydta awr abn amr awr abn zbyr as say mltay awr an say khtay: \hmyn shrakt myn lay lw، kywnkh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay tm pr rhmt nazl ky hay، phr aap an kw shrakt myn lay lytay hyn، wh aksr awnt kay bwjh say faydh athatay awr ghr bhyj dytay thay، awr abdallh bn amr rzy allh anhma as kay sr pr hath phyrtay thay۔\"" awr bkhary nay asay nql kya hay kh as ka mtlb yh hay kh as nay ayk awnt kw as kay bwjh kay sath khryd lya tha، s 344۔"""
2931,abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ansar nay nby krym sly allh alyh wslm say khjwr kay drkhtwn kw apnay awr bhayywn kay drmyan tqsym krnay kw kha، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nhyn، hmary prwrsh ky mshqt say bchao hm tmharay sath phl bantyn gay۔ anhwn nay kha hm nay sna awr man lya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
2932,arwh by۔ abwaljad albaryqy khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn ayk dynar dya takh wh an kay lyay ayk bkry khrydyn۔ as nay as kay lyay dw bkryan khrydyn، an myn say ayk dynar myn bychy awr as kay lyay ayk bhyr awr dynar lay aaya۔ chnanchh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an kay karwbar myn brkt ky daa frmayy awr wh aysay thay kh agr wh mty khrydtay tw as say nfa hasl krtay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
2933,"abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say yh qwl nql kya kh allh taalyٰ ka frman hay kh myn tysra dw shryk bnata hwn jb tk kh an myn say ayk dwsray kw dhwkh nh day lykn jb wh asay dhwkh day tw myn an say alg hw jata hwn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya awr rzyn nay mzyd kha: \awr shytan aata hay۔\"""""
2934,anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: jw tm pr bhrwsh krta hay as pr bhrwsh krw، lykn jw tmhyn dhwkh day asay dhwkh nh dw۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔
2935,jabr rzy allh anh nay kha kh myn nay khybr janay ka aradh kya tw wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyay، aap kw slam kya awr aap kw apna mqsd btaya۔ as nay jwab dya kh jb tm myray ayjnt kay pas aao tw as say pndrh awnt lay jana awr agr wh tm say kwyy nshany chahay tw apna hath as kay gryban pr rkh lay۔ *yh zahr hay kh yh zahr krnay kay lyay phlay say trtyb dy gyy nshany thy kh rswl hqyqy tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
2936,shyb rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn chyzyn aysy hyn jn myn brkt hay: ayk wqt mqrrh kay sath tjart krna، mqrdh* awr gndm awr jw kw apnay ghr walwn kay lyay mlana، lykn frwkht kay lyay nhyn۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔ * ksy kw tjart kay lyay kchh jayydad dyna، dwnwn kay drmyan nfa bantna، lykn jayydad pr hwnay wala kwyy nqsan۔
2937,hkym by۔ hzam nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay ayk dynar day kr bhyja kh as kay lyay qrbany ka janwr khryday۔ as nay ayk dynar myn ayk bkry khrydy، asay dw myn bycha، waps aaya، ayk dynar myn qrbany ka janwr khryda awr as azafy dynar kay sath laya jw as nay hasl kya tha۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay dynar btwr sdqh dya awr as ky tjart myn brkt ky daa ky۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔
2938,sayd by۔ zyd rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay nahq zmyn ka rqbh lay lya tw qyamt kay dn as ky grdn myn sat zmynwn kay brabr hsh dala jayay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)
2939,abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy shkhs ksy aadmy kay janwr kw as ky ajazt kay bghyr dwdh nh playay، kya tm myn say kwyy yh psnd kray ga kh as kay bala khanay myn dakhl hw، as kay khzanay kw twra jayay awr as ka khana chhyn lya jayay؟ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔
2940,ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apny bywywn myn say ayk kay sath thay tw an ky maon myn say ayk nay ayk pyalh bhyja js myn khana tha awr js kay ghr myn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay nwkr kay hath pr mara as kay ntyjay myn wh pyalh gr gya awr tkray tkray hw gya۔ nby sly allh alyh wslm nay pyalay kay tkray jma kyay، phr as myn jw khana tha wh jma krna shrwa kr dya awr frmaya: tmhary man kw ghyrt hay۔ phr as nay nwkr kw as wqt tk rwk lya jb tk kh wh js kay ghr myn tha ayk pyalh tyar nh kr dya، js ka pyalh twta hwa tha asay aawaz ka pyalh dya awr twtay hwyay kw twrnay walay kay ghr myn rkh dya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
2941,abdallh by۔ yzyd nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ghybt awr ghybt say mna frmaya hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ 1. ya tw malِ ghnymt ky tqsym say phlay jng myn ghnymt myn say kchh lay lyna، ya ksy mslman ky ksy chyz kw hasl krna۔ 2. yhan hwalh srf janwrwn kay baz hswn kw katnay ka hw skta hay، lykn as ka atlaq ansanwn pr bhy hw skta hay۔
2942,jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn swrj grhn hwa js dn aap kay bytay abrahym ky wfat hwyy، aap nay lwgwn kw chh rkat nmaz char sjday prhayy awr swrj grhn say nklnay kay bad khtm kya۔ phr frmaya kh tm say kwyy aysy chyz nhyn hay js ka wadh myn nay apny as nmaz myn nh dykha hw، jhnm layy gyy، awr yh wh wqt tha jb tm nay mjhay as khwf say pychhay httay hwyay dykha kh khyn as ky grmy mjhay lg jayay، myn nay as myn apny antrywn kw jhnm myn ghsyttay hwyay dykha، tyrhy chhry ka malk jw hajywn say apny tyrhy chhry say chwry kya krta tha، agr yh tyrhy chhry lg gyy tw yh khh rha tha kh as nay khwd hy as chyz kw jwr dya۔ as kay sath chltay hwyay myn nay as awrt kw bhy dykha js nay ayk bly kw bandh rkha tha awr asay zmyn pr ryngnay waly chyzyn khanay ky ajazt nhyn thy kh wh bhwk say mr gyy thy، awr yh wh wqt tha jb aap nay mjhay aagay brhtay hwyay dykha awr myry jgh pr khray hw kr as ka mtlb yh tha kh myn nay as say bhtr nhyn smjha۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔
2943,qtadh nay ans rzy allh anh say sna kh jb mdynh myn ghbraht hwyy tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay abw tlhh rzy allh anh say almndwb namy ghwra lya js pr aap swar hwyay۔ jb wh waps aaya tw as nay kha kh myn nay kchh bhy nhyn dykha awr myn nay dykha kh ghwra ayk bry ndy ky trh tyzy say dwr skta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)
2944,sayd by۔ zyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy bnjr zmyn kw zrkhyz bnayay tw wh as ky mlkyt hay، lykn as ka kwyy hq nhyn jw zmyn myn nahq kasht kray“۔ asay ahmd، trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔
2945,malk nay asay mrsl ky shkl myn arwh ky snd say mntql kya۔ trmzy nay kha kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔
2946,abwhryrh rqashy apnay chcha ky snd say byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm zlm nh krw awr ksy aadmy ka mal as ky khyr khwahy kay bghyr nhyn lya ja skta۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn awr darqtny nay almjtbyٰ myn nql kya hay۔
2947,'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy kw dwr myn pychhay say ghwray pr swar krnay ky trghyb dyna، dwr myn swar hwnay walay ghwray kay pas ghwra rkhna js pr swar mntql hw jayay، awr bghyr jhyz kay ksy awrt ka nkah krna aslam myn jayz nhyn، awr lwt mar krnay wala hm myn say nhyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ 1. ya jlbh wala jnabt۔ as fqray ka ayk mfhwm yh hay kh trjmh myn zahr kya gya hay، awr ghalbaً why hay jw yhan mqswd hay۔ ayk awr many yh hay kh zkw lynay walay kw chahyay kh as kay pas janwrwn kw dwr say laya jayay awr jb lwg yh snyn kh zkw lynay wala an kay pas aarha hay tw apnay janwrwn kw dwr say nh htayay۔ sy ayf s 375. 2. shghr۔
2948,"alsayb b۔ yzyd nay apnay wald say rwayt ky hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say kwyy apnay bhayy ky asa kw tklyf dynay ky nyt say mzaq myn nh lay، jw kwyy apnay bhayy ky lathy lay wh asay waps kray۔ trmzy awr abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay، mokhr alzkr ka nskhh \jhnjhlaht ka baas\"" pr khtm hwta hay۔"""
2949,smrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy apny asl jayydad ksy kay pas payay tw as ka zyadh hqdar hay، awr khrydar kw bychnay walay pr mqdmh krna chahyay۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔
2950,anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw hath athata hay wh as wqt tk zmh dar hay jb tk wh ada nh kr day۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔
2951,hrm b; sad b۔ mhysh nay kha kh jb ayk awntny jw albraa bn aazb ky thy۔ azb ayk bagh myn dakhl hwyay awr nqsan phnchaya، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh baghat kay malkan dn kw an ky hfazt kay zmh dar hyn، lykn rat kay wqt janwrwn say jw nqsan phnchay as ky zmh dary an kay malkwn pr aayd hwty hay۔ asay malk، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔
2952,hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh agr paon kw rwnda jayay tw kwyy maawzh nhyn lya ja skta awr yhy bat aag kay maamlay myn bhy hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ * ya as ka mtlb yh hw skta hay kh agr ksy janwr kw lat mary jayay tw kwyy maawzh tlb nhyn kya ja skta۔
2953,hsn smrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy aysay janwrwn pr aayay js ka malk an myn say hw tw asay chahyay kh as say ajazt lay، agr nhyn tw tyn bar pkaray awr agr kwyy asay jwab day tw as say ajazt tlb kray، lykn agr kwyy asay jwab nh day tw wh dwdh nkal kr py lay، lykn lay kr nh jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
2954,abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy bagh myn jayay tw kha lay، lykn apnay kprwn myn say kwyy chyz nh ataray۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔
